msgstr "Examinar…"

#, kde-format
msgid "The backup is restored without overwriting the current vault."
msgstr "La copia se restaura sin sobrescribir la bóveda actual."

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A new vault will be created from this backup, and GnuPG will ask for your "
"private key's passphrase."
msgstr ""
"Se creará una bóveda nueva a partir de esta copia y GnuPG te pedirá la "
"contraseña de tu clave privada."

