#, kde-format
msgid "The folder could not be deleted."
msgstr "No se pudo eliminar la carpeta."

#, kde-format
msgid "Delete the folder “%1”?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar la carpeta «%1»?"

#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The folder, its subfolders and all their items, including those in the "
"trash, will be permanently deleted. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"La carpeta, sus subcarpetas y todos sus elementos, incluidos los de la "
"papelera, se eliminarán definitivamente. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."

#, kde-format
msgid "Its items and subfolders will move to the parent folder."
msgstr "Sus elementos y subcarpetas pasarán a la carpeta superior."

#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Also delete the items and subfolders"
msgstr "Eliminar también los elementos y subcarpetas"

