"This is a key from your vault and it is not in GnuPG: it will be created "
"when you import it."
msgstr "Es una clave de tu bóveda y no está en GnuPG: se creará al importarla."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:174
msgid ""
"This is a key from your vault. GnuPG only has its public part: the private "
"part will be added."
msgstr ""
"Es una clave de tu bóveda. GnuPG solo tiene su parte pública: se añadirá la "
"parte privada."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:177
msgid ""
"This is a key from your vault and it is already in GnuPG: it will be merged "
"(new identities, subkeys and signatures). Nothing is deleted."
msgstr ""
"Es una clave de tu bóveda y ya está en GnuPG: se combinará (identidades, "
"subclaves y firmas nuevas). No se borra nada."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:180
msgid ""
"This key is not the active vault's primary key and does not encrypt any of "
"its items. It was rejected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Esta clave no es la principal de la bóveda activa ni cifra ninguno de sus "
"elementos. Se rechazó automáticamente."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:183
msgid ""
"There is no active vault to compare with. It was rejected automatically."
msgstr ""
"No hay una bóveda activa con la que comparar. Se rechazó automáticamente."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:186
msgid ""
"GnuPG could not be queried to review the key. It was rejected automatically."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo consultar GnuPG para revisar la clave. Se rechazó automáticamente."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:240
msgid "The key no longer belongs to the active vault. Nothing was imported."
msgstr "La clave ya no pertenece a la bóveda activa. No se importó nada."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:243
msgid ""
"The received block is not a single passphrase-protected private key with the "
"offered fingerprint. Nothing was imported."
msgstr ""
"El bloque recibido no es una única clave privada protegida con contraseña "
"con la huella ofrecida. No se importó nada."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:246
msgid ""
"GnuPG could not import the key. Check GnuPG and try again from the phone."
msgstr ""
"GnuPG no pudo importar la clave. Revisa GnuPG y vuelve a intentarlo desde el "
"teléfono."

#: crates/kp-desktop/src/ui_adapters/synthetic_key_transfer.rs:249
msgid ""
"The key was imported into GnuPG, but the challenge could not be decrypted "
"(passphrase canceled or wrong?). The phone will not receive a confirmation."
msgstr ""
"La clave se importó en GnuPG, pero no se pudo descifrar el desafío "
"(¿contraseña cancelada o incorrecta?). El teléfono no recibirá confirmación."

